#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:5
msgid "Save Project"
msgstr "保存项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:7
msgid ""
"The current `project`_ can be saved from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and using "
"the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"当前 `项目 <project_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ "
"中保存，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:10
msgid ""
"One `project`_ is conformed by a simple file with ``.qet`` format. The "
"``.qet`` extension is the native extension from QElectroTech."
msgstr ""
"1 `项目 <project_>`_ 由一个简单的文件符合 ``.qet`` 格式。 ``.qet`` 扩展是 QElectroTech 的本地扩展 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:14
msgid "Save project from Menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏保存项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:16
msgid "Select **File > Save** menu item to save the active `project`_."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 保存** 菜单项以保存活动 `项目 <project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:21
#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:33
msgid ""
"At the case that the `project`_ has already been saved and wants to be saved"
" as a different `project`_, different name and/or directory:"
msgstr "在 `项目 <project_>`_ 已被保存并想作为不同的 `项目 <project_>`_，不同名称和/或目录保存的情况下："

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select **File > Save as** menu item to save the active `project`_ as a new "
"`project`_."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 另存为** 菜单项以保存活动 `项目 <project_>`_ 作为新 `项目 <project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:27
msgid "Save project from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏中保存项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select the icon |document-save| from `toolbar`_ to save the active "
"`project`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |document-save| 来保存活动 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:31
msgid "document-save"
msgstr "文档保存"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:36
msgid ""
"Select the icon |document-save-as| from `toolbar`_ to save the active "
"`project`_ as a new `project`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |document-save-as| ,将活动 `项目 <project_>`_ 保存为新 `项目 "
"<project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:38
msgid "document-save-as"
msgstr "文档保存为"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:42
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:45
msgid "Save project using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键保存项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:47
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:49
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + s`` to save the active `project`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + s`` 以保存活动 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:53
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/project/save_project.rst:57
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating backup from `project`_ periodically. This "
"option should be configured at **Settings > Configure QElectroTech > "
"Projects**."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许定期从 `项目 <project_>`_ 创建备份。 此选项应配置在 **设置 > 配置 QEectroTech > "
"Project** 。"
